== VERDICTS ==
X-6 (B-2b): PASS. A single quote in new_nickname round-trips INTACT ("it's a switch").
  Four shell-metacharacter payloads ('; touch, $( ), backticks, SQL-style) were all
  accepted with 200 and stored VERBATIM; the canary file was never created, so nothing
  reached a shell. No response named any component. State restored (nickname back to s1).
X-7 (B-4): see the HTTP code above; the quote-bearing case and the plain control are
  compared side by side so the quote is not confounded with the schema.

MINOR observation, recorded not claimed as a defect: /ndt/received_a_simulation_case
  discloses its required fields in BATCHES -- first 'simulator, version, case_id,
  inputfile', then 'app_id' - so a caller needs 3 round trips to learn the schema.
